SUMMARY:Committee of the Whole Meeting
DESCRIPTION:School Board’s BoardDocs transition \n\nThe School District of Lancaster is in the process of transitioning from BoardDocs to a new platform for school board meeting agendas and minutes. During this transition\, access to past agendas and meeting minutes may be temporarily unavailable. \nWe appreciate the community’s patience as we complete this update. Meeting materials will be restored as soon as possible. We will provide further updates. \n\nClick here to view the agenda\nClick here to watch board meeting 
